# =============================================================================
# Chatbot UI - Environment Configuration
# =============================================================================
# This is the main .env.example file at the project root
# Copy this file to .env and configure your settings

# Backend configuration is in: backend/.env.example
# Frontend configuration (if needed) is in: frontend/.env.example

# Quick Start:
# 1. Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env
# 2. Configure your API keys and settings in backend/.env
# 3. Run: npm run dev (from frontend/) and uvicorn main:app --reload (from backend/)

# For detailed configuration options, see:
# - Backend config: backend/.env.example
# - Documentation: docs/PROVIDER_QUICK_START.md
